    "title": "Storm damage leaves trees down near homes, businesses - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kayla Johnson Taylor Fleming ,\n2 hours ago ILLINOIS (25News Now) - Storm damage in Chillicothe and Pekin after strong winds moved through the area. Video from Cloverdale Street in Chillicothe showed the storm left behind downed trees and damaged property. Some trees fell close to homes and nearby businesses. Large branches blocked parts of the street and were scattered across yards. Read full article",
